{"id":"82b3aa308217ac57","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-numeration-existence.md","title":"Correct Numeration Without Soundness","display":"thm-numeration-existence — Correct Numeration Without Soundness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-numeration-existence","aliases":["67-thm-numeration-existence"],"display":"thm-numeration-existence — Correct Numeration Without Soundness","depends_on":["[[67-df-numeration]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":3,"source_label":"Theorems 1, 1-prime","source_printed_pages":"42–43","source_pdf_pages":"53–54","source_proof_status":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-numeration-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-numeration-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-numeration-existence — Correct Numeration Without Soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorems 1, 1-prime"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"42–43"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"53–54"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已核对；未独立完成全部基础事实或原书证明的形式验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq Q\">\\(T\\supseteq Q\\)</span> 为一致原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 递归可枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 为至多一个自由变量的算术公式集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\)</span> 在本原子精确指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\">\\(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是数词实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar n)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar n)\\)</span> 中被代入的指定变量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T(\\xi,X),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\eta\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\eta,X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T(\\xi,X),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\eta\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\eta,X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorems 3.1, 3.1′, pp.42–43。构造 ξ(k) 自指“存在 X 的枚举见证，且在该见证之前没有 ξ(k) 的证明”；最短证明分析得到精确 numeration 和标准真值对应。无需 Σ1-sound；Π1 numeration 一般不能再要求 correct，否则 X 必须递归。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-numeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-numeration","status":"resolved","id":"9c200c8ec3685766","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]；$\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]；$\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists\\xi\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T(\\xi,X),\\\\\n&\\exists\\eta\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}\\quad\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\eta,X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1767,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-numeration-existence]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-numeration-existence]]；[[../67-thm-disjoint-numerations]]；[[../67-df-independent-formula]]；[[../67-df-independence-type]]；[[../67-thm-independence-type-realization]]；[[../67-thm-positive-prime-type-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["9c200c8ec3685766","851cd80e64893935"]}